# 🛡️ Inquiry Form & Admin Dashboard — Full Security Audit & Fix Plan

Comprehensive end-to-end audit of the inquiry form submission pipeline, booking system, and admin dashboard. Covers security, abuse prevention, data flow integrity, and production readiness.

