## 🔧 Proposed Changes

### Phase 1: Form Security & Abuse Prevention

---

#### [MODIFY] [inquiryService.ts](file:///c:/Users/Nitro%20V15/Documents/GitHub/react-portfolio-2k26/src/services/inquiryService.ts)

- **Add client-side rate limiting** — Track submission timestamps in `sessionStorage`. Block if less than 30 seconds since last submission. Block if more than 5 submissions in 10 minutes.
- **Add input sanitization** — Trim all text fields before DB insert. Strip potential HTML/script tags from text fields using a simple escape function.
- **Move Discord webhook to server-side** — Remove `VITE_DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL` usage from client code. Move the Discord notification trigger to the Netlify serverless function instead.
- **Add email notification call** — After Supabase insert succeeds, call the Netlify function `/api/inquiry` to also send the email notification (fixing C7).

#### [MODIFY] [ProjectInquiryForm.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Nitro%20V15/Documents/GitHub/react-portfolio-2k26/src/components/home/ProjectInquiryForm.tsx)

- **Add honeypot field** — Add a hidden `website2` input field. If filled (by bots), silently reject the submission.
- **Add submission timing check** — Record the timestamp when the form mounts. If the user submits within 3 seconds of loading (humanly impossible for a 3-step form), reject as bot.
- **Add duplicate submit guard** — Use a ref to track if a submission is already in-flight, preventing double-clicks regardless of React state timing.

#### [MODIFY] [Step3Requirements.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Nitro%20V15/Documents/GitHub/react-portfolio-2k26/src/components/home/inquiry/Step3Requirements.tsx)

- **Add max file count** — Limit to 5 attachments total.
- **Add total file size cap** — 15MB total across all files.
- **Add file type validation** — Validate MIME type on the File object itself (not just extension).

#### [MODIFY] [inquirySchema.ts](file:///c:/Users/Nitro%20V15/Documents/GitHub/react-portfolio-2k26/src/types/inquirySchema.ts)

- **Add max length to description** — Cap at 5000 characters.
- **Add phone format regex** — Optional, but if present must match a phone-like pattern.
- **Add max length to fullName** — Cap at 100 characters.
- **Add max length to company** — Cap at 200 characters.

