### Phase 3: Database & RLS Fixes

---

#### [NEW] [supabase/migrations/00005_security_fixes.sql](file:///c:/Users/Nitro%20V15/Documents/GitHub/react-portfolio-2k26/supabase/migrations/00005_security_fixes.sql)

- **Add public SELECT on bookings (limited columns)** — Allow anonymous users to read only `booked_date`, `booked_time`, `status` columns from `bookings` where `status != 'cancelled'`. This fixes the availability slot checking for anonymous visitors (C8).
- **Add UNIQUE constraint on bookings** — `UNIQUE(booked_date, booked_time)` WHERE `status NOT IN ('cancelled')` to prevent double-bookings (I9).
- **Set storage bucket file size limit** — `ALTER` the `inquiry-attachments` bucket to have a `file_size_limit` of 5MB.
- **Restrict storage upload policy** — Add path/extension restrictions to the storage upload policy.

