## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q1: Do you want CAPTCHA (Cloudflare Turnstile) on the inquiry form?**
> A honeypot + timing check blocks most bots, but sophisticated spam bots can bypass these. Cloudflare Turnstile is free and invisible (no user interaction). I'd recommend adding it, but it requires a Cloudflare account. Let me know if you'd like this included.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q2: Should the Netlify function email notification be triggered from the client after Supabase insert, or should it replace the direct Supabase insert?**
> Currently the form writes directly to Supabase (client → Supabase). I recommend keeping this and additionally calling the Netlify function for email notification only. The alternative is routing everything through the Netlify function (client → Netlify → Supabase + Email), which is more secure but adds a layer.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q3: Do you want to keep the `api/inquiry.ts` (Vercel-style) file, or can I remove it?**
> You deploy on Netlify, and this file is never called. I recommend deleting it to avoid confusion.

